# TLS in front of warte (operator duty: ci-source). Replace:
# warte.example.internal, 127.0.0.1:8080 (warte's bind address).
# The four probe routes carry their own authentication (a one-time token,
# then a signature by the enrolled key) and must stay reachable for POST.
# With [auth] in warte.toml, warte itself asks for a login for personal data;
# without it, put a login here and leave those four routes outside it.
warte.example.internal {
	handle_path /warte/* {
		reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
	}
}
